exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__codex_apps__heptaruntime_mac_controller_search_start(args: {
  // Include up to 10 surrounding lines on either side of a text match; default 0.
  context_lines?: number;
  // File searches may finish after a literal exact basename match; default false.
  early_termination?: boolean;
  // Up to 32 ripgrep exclusion globs (512 bytes each); leading ! restores a match. Excluded directories are pruned.
  exclude_patterns?: Array<string>;
  // Ordered ripgrep globs separated by |; leading ! excludes, last match wins (16 globs, 512 bytes total).
  file_pattern?: string;
  host: string;
  // Case-insensitive text/name matching; glob rules use ripgrep's ASCII byte folding. Omitted preserves case sensitivity.
  ignore_case?: boolean;
  include_hidden?: boolean;
  kind: "files" | "content";
  // Optional compatibility spelling: true selects literal, false selects regex; conflicts are refused.
  literal_search?: boolean;
  // At most 64 MiB read; default 64 MiB. Individual files above 4 MiB are skipped.
  max_bytes?: number;
  // At most 10000 traversed entries; default 10000.
  max_entries?: number;
  // At most 1000 results; default 1000.
  max_results?: number;
  // Query of 1..512 UTF-8 bytes; NUL and newlines are refused.
  query: string;
  // Omitted mode preserves case-sensitive literal substring matching. Glob is for file searches.
  query_mode?: "literal" | "regex" | "glob";
  // Absolute root under this configured host's read policy; symlink components are refused.
  root: string;
  // At most 30 seconds worker wall budget; default 30. Blocking OS I/O may delay termination.
  timeout_seconds?: number;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

Read an immutable terminal page for a search owned by the verified private HTTP operator credential, or by this stdio native session. Same-credential HTTP reconnect and controller restart preserve metadata access only while the current host binding and read-root policy authorize access; credential changes never grant older ownership. Running work reports snapshot_ready=false and exposes only its fsynced committed result prefix with progressive=true. Terminal pages remain immutable. Maximum 32 rows and 96 KiB per page, independent row cursors. No host or owner override, running-program restore or authenticated ChatGPT caller isolation. This tool is part of plugin `HeptaRuntime Mac Controller`.

